  <version>1.0.0-pre.0</version>
  <supportedClientVersions>[5.4.0-beta.6,6.0.0)</supportedClientVersions>
  <summary>Guards Domain designer elements (entities, enums, value objects, repositories, data contracts, domain services) by merging their modelled members into existing C# files, never touching method bodies, and checks the model for drift from the code.</summary>
  <description>Guards Domain designer elements (entities, enums, value objects, repositories, data contracts, domain services) by merging their modelled members into existing C# files, never touching method bodies, and checks the model for drift from the code.</description>
